# D3-PO-001: Polymer identity cannot be reduced to a single float/sink test
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 PE 0.5g
add v1 PP 0.5g
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 PET 0.5g
add v2 PS 0.5g
look v1
look v2
measure v1 density
measure v2 density
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
